  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1152",
    "issue_date": "2026-05-31T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-31T11:38:36.047Z",
    "meteorologist": "Binu Maharjan",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा उपल्लो वायुमण्डलमा रहेको पश्चिमी न्युन चापीय रेखा (trough), स्थानीय वायू तथा पश्चिम देखि पुर्व सम्म नेपाल नजिक रहेको न्युन चापिय रेखाको प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, Nepal is under the influence of a westerly low-pressure trough in the upper atmosphere, local winds, and a low-pressure trough extending near Nepal from west to east.",
    "today_np": "लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेश लगायत देशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल, कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ र बाँकी तराई भू-भागमा मुख्यतया सफा रहने छ। सुदूरपश्चिम र कर्णाली प्रदेश लगायत कोशी, बागमती गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा तथा  लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराई भूभागका एक-दुई स्थानमा  हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Himalayan region of the country, including Lumbini Province, Karnali Province, and Sudurpashchim Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly regions of Koshi Province, Bagmati Province, and Gandaki Province, while the remaining Terai regions are expected to remain mainly fair.  There is a possibility of light rainfall/snowfall at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Sudurpashchim Province and Karnali Province, as well as the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi Province, Bagmati Province, Gandaki Province, and Lumbini Province, and at one or two places in the Terai region of Lumbini Province.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ तथा तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। कर्णाली र सुदुरपश्चिम प्रदेश लगायत कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा तथा कोशी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका  तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country, while partly cloudy conditions are expected over the Terai region. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Karnali Province and Sudurpashchim Province, as well as the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi Province, Bagmati Province, and Gandaki Province, and at one or two places in the Terai regions of Koshi Province and Lumbini Province.",
    "special": ""
  }
